  "referenceNumber": "RUS1327",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect Gulbakhor ISMAILOVA is the sister of Alisher USMANOV, an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019.  USMANOV was designated by the UK on 3 March 2022.  As an immediate family member of USMANOV, Gulbakhor ISMAILOVA is associated with an involved person and therefore ISMAILOVA is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions)  (EU Exit) Regulations 2019.\nThe trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.\n",
